{"sha": "d4f28d478c8b65973195422a87cbf475316f61dc2235ba4511acec7920c07cfd", "body": ["\\begin{example}[单摆的相图]\\label{ex:b3:hamiltonian-mechanics:pendulum-portrait}", "对于 $H = p^2/2m\\ell^2 - mg\\ell\\cos\\theta$，", "环绕 $(0, 0)$ 的闭合卵形曲线是\\emph{摆动}，即普通的摆动；", "$|p|$ 较大处的波浪形曲线是\\emph{转动}，即单摆越过最高点翻转；", "穿过 $\\theta = \\pm\\pi$ 处鞍点的是分界线，其能量为 $E = +mg\\ell$，", "沿该分界线，单摆到达最高点需要无穷长的时间。", "位于分界线上的状态，是以\\emph{恰好}", "足够的初速度发出的摆动，它到达倒立位置时别无多余能量。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "    width=11.6cm, height=6.4cm, xmin=-180, xmax=180, ymin=-3.2, ymax=3.2,", "    xlabel={$\\theta$（度）},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.08)}, anchor=north},", "    ylabel={$p$（单位 $m\\ell^2\\omega_0$）},", "    xtick={-180,-90,0,90,180}, ytick={-2,0,2}, clip=false]", "    % librations E/mgl = -0.5 and 0.4 : p = ±sqrt(2(E'+cos x)), E'=E/mgl", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-60:60, samples=80] {sqrt(2*(-0.5+cos(x)))};", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-60:60, samples=80] {-sqrt(2*(-0.5+cos(x)))};", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-113.5:113.5, samples=100] {sqrt(2*(0.4+cos(x)))};", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-113.5:113.5, samples=100] {-sqrt(2*(0.4+cos(x)))};", "    % separatrix E'=1: p=±2cos(x/2)", "    \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=-180:180, samples=100] {2*cos(x/2)};", "    \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=-180:180, samples=100] {-2*cos(x/2)};", "    % rotations E'=2 and 3.5", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=-180:180, samples=100] {sqrt(2*(2+cos(x)))};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=-180:180, samples=100] {-sqrt(2*(2+cos(x)))};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=-180:180, samples=100] {sqrt(2*(3.5+cos(x)))};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=-180:180, samples=100] {-sqrt(2*(3.5+cos(x)))};", "    % fixed points", "    \\fill (axis cs:0,0) circle (1.8pt);", "    \\fill (axis cs:180,0) circle (1.8pt);", "    \\fill (axis cs:-180,0) circle (1.8pt);", "    % flow arrows", "    \\draw[->, thick] (axis cs:-6,1.66) -- (axis cs:6,1.66);", "    \\draw[->, thick] (axis cs:6,-1.66) -- (axis cs:-6,-1.66);", "    \\draw[->, thick] (axis cs:-6,2.45) -- (axis cs:6,2.45);", "    \\draw[->, thick] (axis cs:6,-2.45) -- (axis cs:-6,-2.45);", "    \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:-52,0.5) {摆动};", "    \\node[omThm, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:97,1.75) {分界线};", "    \\node[omExo, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:-172,2.93) {转动};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 单摆的相图：$H$ 的等值线。闭合卵形曲线（摆动）", "绕中心顺时针环流；分界线上方和下方，单摆做转动。", "$\\pm 180^\\circ$ 处的鞍点", "即倒立平衡位置。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[刘维尔定理]\\label{thm:b3:hamiltonian-mechanics:liouville}", "\\index{刘维尔定理}", "哈密顿流保持相空间体积不变：若一组初始状态", "区域沿正则方程被输运，则其体积", "（一个自由度时即面积）始终不变——", "无论其形状如何变化。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "相空间中的流具有速度场 $(\\dot q_i, \\dot p_i) =", "(\\partial_{p_i}H, -\\partial_{q_i}H)$。其散度为", "\\[", "\\sum_i\\Big(\\frac{\\partial\\dot q_i}{\\partial q_i}", " + \\frac{\\partial\\dot p_i}{\\partial p_i}\\Big)", " = \\sum_i\\Big(\\frac{\\partial^2H}{\\partial q_i\\partial p_i}", " - \\frac{\\partial^2H}{\\partial p_i\\partial q_i}\\Big) = 0 :", "\\]", "故该流不可压缩；而不可压缩流输运体积时保持不变，", "与本科二年级分册中的流体情形相同。", "（从零散度到体积守恒的形式化步骤，", "即该处所证明的输运定理。）", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}[刘维尔定理的意义]\\label{rem:b3:hamiltonian-mechanics:liouville-matters}", "牛顿的表述中，没有任何迹象表明有什么是不可压缩的。", "在哈密顿的图景中，这一点是自动成立的——它也正是统计物理学的依据：", "当用相空间中的一团点描述含 $10^{23}$ 个分子的气体时，", "刘维尔定理表明这团点如同不可压缩流体般流动，", "因此“相空间某一体积中的状态数”是", "一个动力学本身既不能产生、也不能消灭的量。", "本分册后文的统计物理学中的微正则假设，", "正立足于此。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  % free particle shear", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (5.2,0) node[right] {$q$};", "    \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,3.0) node[above] {$p$};", "    \\fill[omDef!30, draw=omDef, thick] (0.6,0.8) rectangle (1.6,2.2);", "    \\fill[omDef!30, draw=omDef, thick] (2.7,0.8) -- (3.7,0.8) -- (5.1,2.2) -- (4.1,2.2) -- cycle;", "    \\draw[->, thick] (1.85,1.5) -- (2.5,1.5);", "    \\node at (1.1,0.45) {$t = 0$};", "    \\node at (3.9,0.45) {$t > 0$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (2.6,-0.7) {自由粒子：$\\dot q = p/m$ 使色块剪切};", "  % harmonic oscillator rotation", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=9.6cm]", "    \\draw[->] (-2.6,0) -- (2.8,0) node[right] {$q$};", "    \\draw[->] (0,-1.55) -- (0,2.9) node[above] {$p$};", "    \\draw[gray, dashed] (0,0) circle (1.75);", "    \\fill[omThm!30, draw=omThm, thick] (1.35,0.35) -- (2.15,0.35) -- (2.15,0.95) -- (1.35,0.95) -- cycle;", "    \\begin{scope}[rotate=100]", "    \\fill[omThm!30, draw=omThm, thick] (1.35,0.35) -- (2.15,0.35) -- (2.15,0.95) -- (1.35,0.95) -- cycle;", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\draw[->, thick] (2.0,1.35) arc (35:75:2.35);", "    \\node at (2.5,-0.45) {$t = 0$};", "    \\node at (-1.15,2.45) {$t > 0$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (9.6,-0.7) {谐振子：色块整体刚性转动};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}